Feature: Timesheet security acceptance tests

  Scenario: Timesheet application must be healthy
    When I launch a "generic" attack with:
      """
      curl -fsS http://minikube:30082/timesheet-devops/actuator/health
      """
    Then the output should contain:
      """
      "status":"UP"
      """

  Scenario: Sensitive actuator environment endpoint must not be exposed
    When I launch a "generic" attack with:
      """
      curl -s -o /dev/null -w %{http_code} http://minikube:30082/timesheet-devops/actuator/env
      """
    Then the output should contain:
      """
      404
      """
